# BUZZBOLT: proof the game can be completed. From the opening, the demo
# player skips to the title, picks the FIREFLY and clears all five waves
# on its own, pressing the buttons for real (no cheats). Then the ending,
# the credits, the high-score table and back to the title; the Saucer
# goal is earned and the win is saved.
game buzzbolt
cheat botship 2
botuntil state == 6 40000
expect won == 1
expect wave == 5
expect ship == 2
expect goals & 2
print score
print deaths
print best_mult_run
print es_avg1
print es_avg2
print es_avg3
print es_avg4
print es_avg5
# the shots on screen climb from wave 1 to wave 2 to wave 3, and wave 3
# is the hard one: more than any other wave, the last boss included
expect es_lt_12 == 1
expect es_lt_23 == 1
expect wave3_spike == 1
botuntil state == 0 4000
expect save_wins == 1
expect save_runs == 1
expect save_best2 > 0
